       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ARIT1.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SALDO            PIC S9(7)V99  VALUE 1000.
       01  WS-DEPOSITO         PIC S9(7)V99  VALUE 250.50.
       01  WS-TARIFA           PIC S9(7)V99  VALUE 19.90.
       01  WS-TOTAL            PIC S9(7)V99.
       01  WS-QUOCIENTE        PIC S9(5).
       01  WS-RESTO            PIC S9(5).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ADD WS-DEPOSITO TO WS-SALDO
           DISPLAY "APOS DEPOSITO: " WS-SALDO
           SUBTRACT WS-TARIFA FROM WS-SALDO
           DISPLAY "APOS TARIFA:   " WS-SALDO
           ADD WS-SALDO WS-DEPOSITO GIVING WS-TOTAL
           DISPLAY "TOTAL:         " WS-TOTAL
           MULTIPLY 3 BY WS-TARIFA GIVING WS-TOTAL
           DISPLAY "3 TARIFAS:     " WS-TOTAL
           DIVIDE 17 BY 5 GIVING WS-QUOCIENTE REMAINDER WS-RESTO
           DISPLAY "17 / 5:        " WS-QUOCIENTE " RESTO " WS-RESTO
           GOBACK.
